40. 583.8899999999999864 Td
(Q1: Why did you build both a Mobile App and a Doctor Web Portal?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
40. 572.8899999999999864 Td
(Patients need a private, convenient mobile app to log daily symptoms, temperature, and cycle changes anytime. On the other hand, doctors need) Tj
T* (a desktop-friendly web dashboard with widescreen data visualization, multi-cycle trend charts, and clinical PDF reviews to evaluate patients during) Tj
T* (clinical consultations without looking at a phone screen.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
40. 532.8899999999999864 Td
(Q2: Why use ONNX Runtime on the phone instead of calling a Python server?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
40. 521.8899999999999864 Td
(Menstrual and reproductive health data is highly personal and sensitive under HIPAA and data privacy principles. Transmitting raw symptoms to a) Tj
T* (remote server creates security risks and requires a constant internet connection. By compiling our trained Rotterdam model to ONNX format and) Tj
T* (loading it directly in Android using our custom Kotlin plugin \(OnnxPredictorPlugin\), inference runs in under 30 milliseconds completely offline.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
40. 481.8899999999999864 Td
(Q3: How does your PCOS diagnosis differ from standard cycle trackers?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
40. 470.8899999999999864 Td
(Standard trackers only look at missed days. HealthTrack+ implements the international 2003/2018 Rotterdam Consensus Guidelines, evaluating) Tj
T* (19 parameters including hyperandrogenism \(mFG hirsutism, cystic acne, alopecia\) and medication masking overrides for birth control, classifying) Tj
T* (patients into Phenotypes A, B, C, or D.) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8 Tf
